  "parsing_rules_fixed_in_advance": [
   "The formula «صوت يدل على» (row 0: «صوت خفيف يدل على») is the table's frame and is not decomposed.",
   "Each gloss is split into alternatives on «،» and «أو».",
   "Within an alternative: action = the head noun(s); intensity = a word of the closed scale خفيف · وسط · شديد · شديد جداً; ending = any other qualifier, vocabulary taken from the table.",
   "A qualifier attaches to the NEAREST noun, uniformly.",
   "Row 0's «خفيف» qualifies «صوت», not the action, and is recorded as such."
  ],
  "applications_recorded_here": [
   "Nouns coordinated by و inside one alternative (row 12 «انتشار وتفش», row 26 «إثارة و امتداد») are both heads: the action slot holds a list. و is not أو and does not open an alternative.",
   "The ending slot holds a list when an alternative carries several qualifiers (rows 11, 13, 22, 27, 28). The design fixed three slots, not one word per slot.",
   "A prepositional qualifier is kept whole as one ending («في الشيء», «في الزمان والمكان»).",
   "Row 22's «ثقيلة» is not on the closed intensity scale, so it is an ending by the rule. That it reads like an intensity is recorded below as an observation, not acted on.",
   "Row 0's second sentence «وهو جزء من صوت (آ)» is a relation between rows, which design.md §D4 forbids structuring. It is therefore RESIDUE: the three-slot scheme does not cover it."
  ]
 },
